{#
  BeMart Customer-activation-complete page — EC-CUBE
  doActivateCustomer landing (email-verification complete).

  PORT of EC-CUBE 4.3 default-theme `Entry/activate.twig`
  (src/Eccube/Resource/template/default/Entry/activate.twig).

  DATA page (no form) — the data-page recipe (see var/templates/
  README.md). EC-CUBE shows this static confirmation after the
  email-verification link flips the customer provisional -> active.
  Markup skeleton, `ec-role` / `ec-pageHeader` / `ec-registerCompleteRole`
  / `ec-reportHeading` / `ec-off3Grid` / `ec-text-ac` /
  `ec-reportDescription` / `ec-off4Grid` classes + the block structure
  are kept verbatim from EC-CUBE.

  EC-CUBE-ism rebinding (see var/templates/README.md):
   - `{{ 'key'|trans }}`  -> the ja literal from messages.ja.yaml. The
     `front.entry.complete_message__activated` value is a multi-line YAML
     literal; EC-CUBE prints it through `nl2br`, so the port substitutes
     the literal verbatim and applies the same `nl2br`.
   - `canonical-url 'homepage')` / `canonical-url 'cart')` -> deterministic paths
     (BeMartTwigExtension).
   - `qtyInCart` — EC-CUBE checks for a pending cart to offer a
     "カートへ進む" shortcut button. The Activate resource is a thin pure
     renderer; its body carries no cart state, so the `{% if qtyInCart %}`
     block renders empty (the common case — no pending cart). Recorded as
     a residual in the render test.
#}
{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% set body_class = 'registration_page' %}
{% set route = 'entry-activate' %}
{% set title = '新規会員登録(完了)' %}

{% block main %}
    <div class="ec-role">
        <div class="ec-pageHeader">
            <h1>新規会員登録(完了)</h1>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="ec-registerCompleteRole">
        <div class="ec-reportHeading">
            <h2>会員登録ありがとうございます</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="ec-off3Grid ec-text-ac">
            <div class="ec-off3Grid__cell">
                <p class="ec-reportDescription">{{ "会員登録が完了しました。\nメールアドレスとパスワードでログイン後、ショッピングをお楽しみください。\n"|nl2br }}</p>

            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ec-off4Grid">
            <div class="ec-off4Grid__cell">
                {% if qtyInCart|default(false) %}
                    <a class="ec-blockBtn--action" style="margin-bottom: 3px" href="/cart">カートへ進む</a>
                {% endif %}
                <a class="ec-blockBtn--cancel" href="/">トップページへ</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
{% endblock %}
